stool.

309
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:10,900
None of that is dramatic.

310
00:08:10,900 --> 00:08:11,900
All of it was gone

311
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:13,160
for two years.

312
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,780
A few weeks later my wife
asked

313
00:08:14,780 --> 00:08:15,740
