314
00:08:15,740 --> 00:08:17,640
the long way around the
block.

315
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,580
And for the first time

316
00:08:18,580 --> 00:08:19,360
in two years,

317
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,800
I said yes.

318
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,500
I wanted to understand
why,

319
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:24,240
so I read the whole thing.

320
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,850
It comes down to four
steps.

321
00:08:25,850 --> 00:08:26,820
One.

322
00:08:26,820 --> 00:08:29,030
The tissue around a new
knee can

323
00:08:29,030 --> 00:08:33,060
stay inflamed long after
surgery is over.

324
00:08:33,060 --> 00:08:33,570
Two.

325
00:08:33,570 --> 00:08:36,140
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

326
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:37,210
so it takes up more

327
00:08:37,210 --> 00:08:38,740
room than it should.

328
00:08:38,740 --> 00:08:39,250
Three.

329
00:08:39,250 --> 00:08:41,240
There's only so much room
in there.

330
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:43,040
Bending compresses it.

331
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:44,660
Straightening pulls it
tight.

332
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:46,120
That's the squeeze.

333
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,960
Four.

334
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:49,460
Red and near-infrared
light have been

335
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:51,790
studied for calming that
inflammation,

336
00:08:51,790 --> 00:08:53,180
so the swelling and the
pressure

337
00:08:53,180 --> 00:08:54,720
can come down with it.

338
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,370
In a randomized trial,

339
00:08:56,370 --> 00:08:58,180
patients given light
therapy after

340
00:08:58,180 --> 00:08:59,270
a knee replacement

341
00:08:59,270 --> 00:09:00,610
had less pain,

342
00:09:00,610 --> 00:09:01,760
less swelling

343
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,450
and better early movement
than

344
00:09:03,450 --> 00:09:04,650
those who weren't.

345
00:09:04,650 --> 00:09:07,200
A 2025 review said the
same,

346
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,470
and was clear the evidence

347
00:09:08,470 --> 00:09:09,770
is still limited.

348
00:09:09,770 --> 00:09:11,460
I probably sound like a
broken

349
00:09:11,460 --> 00:09:13,250
record to my family.

350
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:15,190
But after two years of
doing everything

351
00:09:15,190 --> 00:09:17,430
I was told and getting
nowhere,

352
00:09:17,430 --> 00:09:18,760
you have no idea what it's

353
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,530
like to sleep through the
night,

354
00:09:20,530 --> 00:09:22,030
say yes to the walk,

355
00:09:22,030 --> 00:09:23,510
and get my life back.

356
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:24,820
So take it from me.

357
00:09:24,820 --> 00:09:26,700
Don't spend another year
waiting

358
00:09:26,700 --> 00:09:27,810
